ChromExplorer 1.4.1

1.	New build system has been introduced
2.	All dependencies have been converted into the NuGet packages
3.	User can copy current peak list into the clipboard in the Wiley 
peak list format

ChromExplorer 1.4.0

1.	This version allow user to specify orientation and placement of 
peak labels

ChromExplorer 1.3.12

1.	Bug with zero m/z in the exported peak list has been fixed

ChromExplorer 1.3.11

1.	Spike removal post-processing operation has been added

ChromExplorer 1.3.10

1.	Installer has been introduced
2.	MODAS chromatogram import settings are persistent now
